onnection</h1></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"><button aria-label=\"Parish Selection &amp; Alerts\" class=\"w-11 h-11 min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\">notifications</span></button><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-[18px]\">person</span></div></div></div></header><main class=\"flex flex-col relative w-full pt-16 pb-28 bg-surface min-h-screen\"><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full\">\n<!-- Prominent Offline Top Banner -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md pt-space-sm pb-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed rounded-xl p-space-md shadow-sm flex items-start gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-tertiary flex items-center justify-center text-on-tertiary flex-shrink-0\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\">wifi_off</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-space-xs\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm leading-tight font-bold\">No internet connection</span>\n<button aria-label=\"Retry connection\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container-lowest px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-tertiary font-label-md text-label-md active:scale-95 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm\" id=\"retry-top-btn\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] transition-transform duration-500\" id=\"retry-top-icon\">refresh</span>\n<span>Retry</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant mt-0.5\">\n          Cached map area and prices shown • Last updated 20 min ago\n        </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Offline Reassurance & Local Vault Card -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-md shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">cloud_sync</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface\">Offline Mode Ready</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary\"></span>\n          2 logs queued locally\n        </span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">\n        You can still log fuel and pin places — we’ll automatically sync them to Roam Plug as soon as your signal catches up.\n      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Map Section: Cached Sector Snapshot -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md pt-space-xs pb-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-44 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center\" data-location=\"Kingston, Jamaica\" style=\"background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC7cgJkoiDjsDFoO6mvtjHK0Kiic3Jgzsbc09u5d0iBGjg3iqCp3mKxcaRGbEcpNEwLwePTVdflplbFYrC0q1QOzmBLQ77PALAewO5i3FxG1xj6stUGB83E9TuC8AaIO8hLjzHAz8aoM-xpf1WspsbAHAXSww3Sr_GM1RS0WCYit32_-ZYFBOlqxgYBgCd3Uq9CoStUpWysCFS1-unwNt3RoPtkQc7eOlgJTNx1Xguy5EKtggBfgN7b')\"></div>\n<!-- Subtle tint overlay for cached feel -->\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-surface-dim/40 backdrop-blur-[1px] flex flex-col justify-between p-space-md pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]\">download_done</span>\n            Cached Sector: Kingston &amp; St. Andrew\n          </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface shadow-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">gps_fixed</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest/95 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm\">\n<span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse\"></span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Storage Vault Active</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant bg-surface-container-lowest/80 px-2 py-1 rounded\">Offline GPS Tracking</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Cached Search Bar -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md pb-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-sm px-space-md flex items-center gap-space-sm shadow-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[20px]\">search</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex-1 truncate\">Searching cached spots in parish...</span>\n<span class=\"bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant text-[10px] font-label-sm px-2 py-1 rounded\">LOCAL ONLY</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Offline Quick Actions Grid -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md pb-space-md\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm\">\n<button aria-label=\"Log Fuel Offline\" class=\"bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-xl p-space-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md active:scale-95 transition-transform min-h-[48px]\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">local_gas_station</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg\">Log Fuel Offline</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"Pin a Place Offline\" class=\"bg-surface-container text-on-surface rounded-xl p-space-md flex items-cen