-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">E-10 87</span>\n<span class=\"font-price-display text-price-display text-on-surface\">J$ 204.85</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">schedule</span>\n<span>Cached 20m ago</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-0.5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Queue: Light • Diesel J$ 212.00</span>\n<button aria-label=\"Route to Rubis Waterloo\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">near_me</span>\n<span>Offline Route</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Card 2: TotalEnergies Half-Way-Tree -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-md shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">local_gas_station</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface leading-tight\">TotalEnergies HWT</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]\" title=\"Saved on Device\">offline_pin</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Half-Way-Tree Clock Tower • Kingston</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\">2.1 km</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">E-10 87</span>\n<span class=\"font-price-display text-price-display text-on-surface\">J$ 205.10</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">schedule</span>\n<span>Cached 20m ago</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-0.5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">E-10 90: J$ 218.40 • Verified</span>\n<button aria-label=\"Route to Total Half-Way-Tree\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">near_me</span>\n<span>Offline Route</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Card 3: Texaco Dunrobin Ave -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-md shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">local_gas_station</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface leading-tight\">Texaco Dunrobin Ave</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]\" title=\"Saved on Device\">offline_pin</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Dunrobin Avenue • St. Andrew</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\">2.8 km</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">E-10 87</span>\n<span class=\"font-price-display text-price-display text-on-surface\">J$ 206.20</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">schedule</span>\n<span>Cached 20m ago</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-0.5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Air Pump • Cash &amp; Card (Offline)</span>\n<button aria-label=\"Route to Texaco Dunrobin\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">near_me</span>\n<span>Offline Route</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Bottom Sync Status & Diagnostics Bar -->\n<div class=\"px-space-md pt-space-xs pb-space-lg\">\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-space-md flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-space-xs\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-error text-[18px] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">sync_problem</span>\n<div class=\"flex-1\">\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-medium leading-tight\">\n            Last sync attempt failed 2m ago • Auto-retrying when cellular or Wi-Fi signal recovers\n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">\n            Digicel / Flow cellular towers unreachable in current pocket.\n          </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm pt-1\">\n<button class=\"flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface rounded-lg py-2.5 px-space-md font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-98 transition-transform min-h-[44px]\" id=\"force-sync-btn\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\" id=\"force-sync-icon\">sync</span>\n<span id=\"force-sync-label\">Force Sync Now</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"Offline Diagnostics\" class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm flex-shrink-0 active:scale-95 transition-transform\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">tune</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  // Simple micro-interaction for sync and retry actions\n  const retryTopBtn = document.getElementById('retry-top-btn');\n  const retryTopIcon = document.getElementById('retry-top-icon');\n  const forceSyncBtn = document.getElementById('force-sync-btn');\n  const forceSyncIcon = document.getElementById('force-sync-icon');\n  const forceSyncLabel = document.getElementById('force-sync-label');\n\n  if (retryTopBtn && retryTopIcon) {\n    retryTopBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      retryTopIcon.classList.add('rotate-180');\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        retryTopIcon.classList.remove('rotate-180');\n      }, 500);\n    });\n  }\n\n  if (forceSyncBtn && forceSyncIcon && forceSyncLabel) {\n    forceSyncBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      forceSyncIcon.classList.add('animate-spin');\n      forceSyncLabel.textContent = 'Checking towers...';\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        forceSyncIcon.classList.remove('animate-spin');\n        forceSyncLabel.textContent = 'No signal found yet';\n        setTimeout(() => {\n          forceSyncLabel.textContent = 'Force Sync Now';\n        }, 2200);\n      }, 1200);\n    });\n  }\n</script></main><nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-50 pb-safe bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_-2px_12px_rgba(28,25,23,0.06)]\" data-active-classes=\"text-primary font-bold\"><div class=\"relative flex justify-around items-center h-16 px-space-xs\"><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 min-h-[48px] min-w-[48px] text-on-surface-variant transition-colors\" data-path=\"home-explore\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\">e